# A deploy form's Deploy button, disabled for a moment: the ring that met it then was refused, and it was never reached again once enabled (it was skipped for good, and given a tabindex=-1 that hid it). A refusal counts for that key press only.
pages/button-enabled-later.html
start:css=#cancel
key:ArrowRight
eval:document.getElementById('deploy').disabled = false
start:css=#cancel
key:ArrowRight
expect:css=#deploy
